<p>Batool kehti thi rokar mere ghareeb pidar,<br>
Yateem hogayi ab mai bala naseeb pidar.</p>

<p>Jaha'n se uthgaye tum koun pooche Zehra ko,<br>
Bas aj sogaye hai hai mere naseeb pidar.</p>

<p>Maza nahi hai kuch ab zeest me hamare liye,<br>
Uthe'nge qalq se ab hum bhi anqareeb pidar.</p>

<p>Tumhare saath tha jeena mujhe bula lijiye,<br>
Jahan me rehke karu kya mai badnaseeb pidar.</p>

<p>Uthaye jayenge sadme na hijr ke mujhse,<br>
Khuda kare ke meri mout ho qareeb pidar.</p>

<p>Hame satane ab ummat ko qouf kiska hai,<br>
Tumhare baad karenge sitam ajeeb pidar.</p>

<p>Kabhi na aapne rahat uthayi duniya me,<br>
Sitam rasida mere faqakash gareeb pidar.</p>

<p>Ab ap kijiye 'Masroor' ki madad gaari,<br>
Uthake zehmatei'n marjayega ghareeb pidar</p>